`.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual environments
.venv/
venv/
env/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Experiment outputs
results/*.csv
results/*.json
results/*.png

# Data
data/*.csv
data/*.parquet
data/*.feather
data/*.pkl

# Logs
*.log
